<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-14139] Incorrect initialize checkpoint-runner-cpu thread pool</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-14139</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;First initialization of checkpoint thread pool for CPU is incorrect.&lt;br/&gt;
Look at the constructor of &lt;tt&gt;CheckpointWorkflow&lt;/tt&gt;:&lt;br/&gt;
At start, we initialize the pool:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;this&lt;/span&gt;.checkpointCollectPagesInfoPool = initializeCheckpointPool();
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;and only after, we set a size of the pool:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;this&lt;/span&gt;.checkpointCollectInfoThreads = checkpointCollectInfoThreads;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
